Notes on what I did not fully implement from the spec:

- **Escort dive point values**: escort count is tracked (400/800/1600) and escorts fly parallel to the Boss, but they are not visually "attached" to the Boss sprite the way the arcade renders them.
- **Challenging-stage wave bonus display**: per-wave 1,000 bonuses are added to the score, but the "BONUS" line on the result screen shows the total; individual per-wave "BONUS 1000" popups are not shown in-game.
- **Tractor beam capture window**: capture is checked only while the Boss hovers (a ~3 s window); the arcade's exact timing curve is approximated.
- **Dual-fighter half-loss on ram**: a ramming enemy destroys the whole ship rather than a single half; bullet hits do damage a single half correctly.
- **Enemy-bullet limit** (6 on screen) is a simplification of the arcade's more complex firing rules; formation enemies' fire pattern is randomized rather than the arcade's choreographed volleys.
- **Stage-bonus flag denominations** beyond stage 13 wrap at the 10,000 denomination.
